N_BROAD_READ: conversations is readable by any signed-in user with a matching memberships row; no particular role or row ownership is required — confirm that every roster member should see all these columns; declare intent from the privacy spec and inspect audit
N_GRANT_OUTLIVES_ROLE: conversations: `exists memberships[.id, viewer]` trusts memberships grants, but this branch does not re-check the reader's current role; existing grants can survive a role change — conjoin the current reader-role probe with the grant branch, or revoke derived grants transactionally on every role change; see guide security
