N_EXISTENCE_ORACLE: edit: lookup absence NOT_FOUND, later denial NOT_AUTHOR; callers admitted by the read rule can distinguish these outcomes — use the same absence/denial code and message when existence is private, or tighten the table read rule; the read gate already hides rows it denies
